 /*
- * topaz: IOService nub publishing WCN3988 / tw0 state into the IORegistry (0140).
- * 0142: also TopazWlanIPv4/Netmask/Gateway/DNS from topaz_wlan_if_ipv4().
- * Not an IONetworkInterface - configd/wifid still need IO80211 later.
- * Match IOResources; poll topaz_wlan_* into properties. topazwlannub=0 skips.
+ * topaz: WCN3988 as IOEthernetController (0145).
+ * 0140/0142 properties stay. attachInterface() publishes IOEthernetInterface
+ * so IONetworkStack can attach a BSD ifnet (typically enN).
+ * Datapath: outputPacket -> topaz_wlan_tx_ethernet; RX via topaz_wlan_enet_set_rx.
+ * tw0 (0133) still attaches unless sweetwlanif=0. Use sweetwlanif=0 so only
+ * the IONetwork ifnet carries traffic (in-kernel wifiip=/DHCP then stays off).
+ * topazwlannub=0 skips. Not IO80211 (wifid still needs that later).
  */
 #if defined(ARM64_BOARD_CONFIG_SWEET)
 
